00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:36.320
that market cap waiting automatically captures the strongest companies. Your order filled at the

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:42.200
prevailing NAV, but the actual mechanism is that inflows mechanically increased demand for the

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:48.560
largest constituents regardless of their current earnings trajectory. In practice, the bid asks spread

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:55.020
on that ETF can widen from two cents to 15 cents in the first 30 minutes of heavy retail flows.

00:02:55.660 --> 00:03:00.840
The underlying stocks themselves experience price pressure that is unrelated to fundamentals.

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:08.240
Professionals always check the ETF's premium or discount to NAV and the concurrent options skew

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:13.960
before adding size. The biggest mistake with passive flows is assuming price discovery remains

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:21.340
unaffected at the margin. Instead, always layer a simple active screen such as free dash cash flow yield

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:28.540
versus the index median on top of any core ETF allocation to avoid becoming the marginal buyer

